        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "For $x=0,1,2,3,4,5$, respectively: $0,\\frac18,\\frac14,\\frac12,\\frac34,1$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}F(0)&=0\\\\F(1)&=1\\left(\\frac18\\right)=\\frac18\\\\F(2)&=2\\left(\\frac18\\right)=\\frac14\\\\F(3)&=\\frac14+1\\left(\\frac14\\right)=\\frac12\\\\F(4)&=\\frac14+2\\left(\\frac14\\right)=\\frac34\\\\F(5)&=\\frac14+3\\left(\\frac14\\right)=1\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "p34-q4-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Plot and graph the CDF and write the CDF in piecewise notation.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$$F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{x}{8},&0\\le x<2,\\\\[2pt]\\dfrac{x}{4}-\\dfrac14,&2\\le x\\le5.\\end{cases}$$",
          "worked": "For $0\\le x<2$:\n$$F(x)=\\frac18x.$$\nFor $2\\le x\\le5$:\n$$\\begin{align*}F(x)&=\\frac14+\\frac14(x-2)\\\\F(x)&=\\frac{x}{4}-\\frac14.\\end{align*}$$\nJoin the points $(0,0)$, $(1,\\frac18)$, $(2,\\frac14)$, $(3,\\frac12)$, $(4,\\frac34)$ and $(5,1)$ with straight segments. The graph is continuous at $x=2$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": [
            {
              "id": "p34-q4-c-graph-answer",
              "role": "solution",
              "format": "tikz",
              "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"cdfBlue\",\"hex\":\"268CFF\",\"reason\":\"CDF answer series\"}],\"reference\":\"source page 34 p34-q4-c-graph-answer\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=0.8cm,y=3cm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{cdfBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}\n\\draw[step=1,line width=0.25pt,color=black!20] (0,0) grid (5,1);\n\\foreach \\y in {0.25,0.5,0.75,1}{\\draw[line width=0.25pt,color=black!20] (0,\\y)--(5.5,\\y);}\n\\draw[line width=0.5pt,->] (-0.2,0)--(5.9,0) node[right] {$x$};\n\\draw[line width=0.5pt,->] (0,-0.1)--(0,1.2) node[right] {$y$};\n\\foreach \\x in {2,4}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (\\x,-0.02)--(\\x,0.02);\\node[below] at (\\x,-0.02) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$\\x$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\foreach \\y in {0.5,1}{\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (-0.06,\\y)--(0.06,\\y);\\node[left] at (0,\\y) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$\\y$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\draw[cdfBlue,line width=0.8pt] (0,0)--(2,0.25)--(5,1);\n\\foreach \\x/\\y in {0/0,1/0.125,2/0.25,3/0.5,4/0.75,5/1}{\\filldraw[draw=cdfBlue,fill=white,line width=0.4pt] (\\x,\\y) circle[radius=1.8pt];}\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
              "src": null,
              "widthMm": 65,
              "alt": "Mathematical diagram",
              "overlayOf": null,
              "transparent": false,
              "axes": null,
              "spec": {
